issue_description:
1. The shelf life of HW products is required to be 6 months. The current warning time set by the system is calculated from the time of warehousing, not the production date of the product; When the production date of the product is far from the warehousing date, the early warning cannot be accurately identified;

2. It is required to change to the MFG DATE CODE on the label for identification, which is the production date of the product;

[https://afcisd.sdpondemand.manageengine.com/app/servicedesk/ui/requests/125487000020868276/details?selectTab=requestDetails&woFrom=ActivitiesList]

